# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for DiscoPoP_UT (used by scripts/dev/run_profiler_sanitizers.sh).
# Format: one "<race|deadlock|mutex|thread|signal|called_from_lib>:<pattern>" per line, see
# https://github.com/google/sanitizers/wiki/ThreadSanitizerSuppressions
# Every entry needs a comment saying why the report is benign or cannot be fixed.
# Prefer fixing the race (e.g. std::atomic for flags polled by worker threads) over adding an entry here.
#
# No entries: DiscoPoP_UT runs race free.
